Because no explicit upstream license was identified for kaixindelele/chinarxiv,
all rights in that upstream project remain with its respective author(s). This
project records attribution for referenced ideas and workflow inspiration.

Major modifications in this project include:

- Packaging the workflow as a Codex skill.
- Using local Codex/subagents for translation orchestration.
- Replacing LaTeX recompilation with BabelDOC PDF layout extraction/rendering.
- Using a JSONL file contract for agent translation batches.
- Adding validation for source hashes, unit IDs, placeholders, and missing
  translations before PDF rendering.

